      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيَّاضٌ</span></b>  <i>A bleacher of clothes;</i> as a kind of rel. n.;
not as a verbal epithet; for were it this, it would
be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبَيِّضٌ</span>. (M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A seller of eggs.</i> (M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيَّاضَةٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيُوضٌ</span>.

